[Event "Checkmate with queen and rook"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "8/8/8/2k5/8/6Q1/7R/4K3 w - - 0 1"]

{ The queen and rook work together like the rungs of a ladder.
  One piece cuts the king off while the other gives check. }
1. Rh4 { [%cal Gh4a4] The rook cuts the king off: it can no longer reach the 4th rank. }
1... Kd5
2. Qg5+ { [%cal Gg5d5,Gh4a4] Check along the 5th rank. The king must step up to the 6th. }
2... Kc6
3. Rh6+ { [%cal Gh6c6,Gg5a5] Now the rook checks, and the queen guards the rank below. }
3... Kb7
4. Qg7+ { [%cal Gg7b7] The queen climbs past the rook and checks on the 7th rank. }
4... Kc8
5. Rh8# { [%cal Gh8c8,Gg7a7] [%csl Rc8] Checkmate! The king is stuck on the edge of the board. }
